# Codebase Structure - Epic Stack

## Project Overview

This is an Epic Stack application built with Remix and React Router v7. The project follows Epic Stack conventions and uses modern web development practices.

## Main Structure

- Single application structure (not a monorepo)
- Uses React Router v7 with Remix compatibility layer
- Built with Vite as the build tool
- SQLite database with Prisma ORM
- Deployed on Fly.io with LiteFS for database replication

